 }

 However, the example uses a ternary operator, but note the rule R4: helm i[1D[K
integer-only, meaning we can only use integer types and operations.

 We are returning 1 when even, so we can use the ternary operator as above.[6D[K
above.

 But note: the view must return an expression that is an int<N>. The ternar[6D[K
